@doc fixtures/broken.resolver.json

# This session asks a synthetic document, fixtures/broken.resolver.json: a reference to no token, a shadow whose blur
# one context overrides alone, and a token one context defines and the defaults do not.

# Everything wrong with the document, in one call.
> check
incomplete:
  card.glow: no value in low/light, high/light
holes:
  card.glow $value: theme=light
  card.glow $type: theme=light
non-factorable:
  card.shadow $value: $value of "card.shadow" is overridden in part: an object merged onto the object beneath it differs from the incoming object alone.
collisions: (none)
— check, load

# The reference to no token, asked for its value: the core's error names the reference.
> value card.border
error: Unresolvable reference {color.missing} in token "broken.card.border" at $value (mode "low/light"): no token at path "color.missing" in collection "broken".
— resolveValue
